flowchart TD
  A[Verify repository, existing deployment, skills] --> B[Baseline screenshots, content and technical audit]
  B --> C[SEO intent and evidence-based art-direction research]
  C --> D[Design direction, source rights and page architecture]
  D --> E[Implement vanilla HTML, CSS, JS, GSAP]
  E --> F[Static build and offline audits]
  F --> G{Browser, accessibility, SEO and link gates pass?}
  G -- No --> E
  G -- Yes --> H[Cloudflare preview test]
  H --> I{Preview gates pass?}
  I -- No --> E
  I -- Yes --> J[Deploy to production custom hostname]
  J --> K{Live HTTPS pages and canonical checks pass?}
  K -- No --> L[Rollback / repair Cloudflare]
  L --> E
  K -- Yes --> M[Configure existing Vercel property redirect]
  M --> N{Legacy 301 or 308 verified?}
  N -- No --> O[Report actual external blocker or repair]
  N -- Yes --> P[Final release report, commit and rollback evidence]
